    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are pleased to bring 49 Cromcastle Drive to the sales market. A well maintained and much loved 3 bedroomed end-of-terrace house, with a sunroom extension to rear and a shower room to side. There are gardens front & rear with a good sized concrete shed suitable for a variety of uses to rear. This mature neighbourhood has a host of established amenities nearby` shops, schools, access to bus routes and for nearby Beaumont hospital. This will be a popular choice for house hunters looking to buy in this mature sought after neighbourhood. Viewing recommended.\n\nSituated in this mature residential location, there are established amenities within the vicinity, a choice of shopping centres Northside/Artane and Lidl/Aldi supermarkets. There are schools, child care facilities, as well as a number of sports clubs. Beaumont hospital, DCU and Dublin International Airport are easily accessible and easy access to M1/M50 motorways. There are a choice of bus routes on the Oscar Traynor Road."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance\n\nReception Hall\nPVC double glazed front door & screen. Tiled floor.\n\nDownstairs Shower Room\nShower tray, screen, whb and wc. fully tiled floor & walls.\n\nLounge - 4.47m (14'8\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nMarble fireplace. Laminate flooring. Double glazed doors to sunroom.\n\nSunroom - 4.62m (15'2\") x 3.54m (11'7\")\nPVC double glazed. Laminate flooring. PVC doors to rear.\n\nKitchen - 4.55m (14'11\") x 1.94m (6'4\")\nRange of fitted press units. Tiled behind worktop. Plumbed for washing machine & dishwasher. Tiled floor. Door to:-\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.94m (9'8\") x 2.85m (9'4\")\nHotpress.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.95m (9'8\") x 2.65m (8'8\")\nLaminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.7m (8'10\") x 2.33m (7'8\")\nLaminate flooring.\n\nBathroom\nBath, screen, electric shower, whb and wc. Tiled walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
