        "Content": "<ul><li> Gas central heating </li><li> Large sunroom extension to rear </li><li> Downstairs shower room & upstairs bathroom </li><li> Off street parking </li><li> Concrete shed to rear </li><li> Sought after address </li><li> Gardens front & rear</li></ul>"
      },
